  "description": "Advanced C# and VB syntax languages for use with the Actipro WinForms SyntaxEditor control.\n\nFeatures of this optional .NET Languages Add-on (sold separately from SyntaxEditor) include automated IntelliPrompt, type/member resolution, background parsing with AST building, syntax error reporting, automatic outlining and more.\n\nDocumentation is available on the Actipro web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/docs/controls/winforms/index?v=26.1), and samples can be downloaded from the Actipro WinForms Controls GitHub repository (https://github.com/Actipro/WinForms-Controls).\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires proper paid licensing for legal usage. See Actipro's web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/purchase) for links to purchase developer licenses, or view the Sales FAQ for more information about evaluations and licensing.",
